{"id":"a92e0473734a9033","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-interpretation-order.md","title":"df-interpretation-order","display":"df-interpretation-order","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-interpretation-order","aliases":["56-df-interpretation-order"],"display":"df-interpretation-order","depends_on":["[[56-df-well-founded-monotone-algebra]]","[[56-df-satisfaction]]","[[56-df-terms]]"],"source_section":"6.2.1 following definition","source_pages":"184","source_ocr_blocks":[205],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"not-applicable"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-interpretation-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-interpretation-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-interpretation-order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"54517e5af9b2ee4a\" href=\"?note=54517e5af9b2ee4a\" title=\"56-df-well-founded-monotone-algebra\">56-df-well-founded-monotone-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b729ff69dbfa830d\" href=\"?note=b729ff69dbfa830d\" title=\"56-df-satisfaction\">56-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"6.2.1 following definition"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"184"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>205</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Algebra}_\\Sigma(A,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Algebra}_\\Sigma(A,I)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq A^2\">\\(Q\\subseteq A^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in T\">\\(s,t\\in T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^{(A,I)}[\\beta]\">\\(u^{(A,I)}[\\beta]\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b729ff69dbfa830d\" href=\"?note=b729ff69dbfa830d\" title=\"56-df-satisfaction\">56-df-satisfaction</a> 的项解释，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in A^V\">\\(\\beta\\in A^V\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s&gt;_{(A,I,Q)}^{\\Sigma,V}t\\iff\n\\forall\\beta\\in A^V\\;\ns^{(A,I)}[\\beta]\\;Q\\;t^{(A,I)}[\\beta].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s&gt;_{(A,I,Q)}^{\\Sigma,V}t\\iff\n\\forall\\beta\\in A^V\\;\ns^{(A,I)}[\\beta]\\;Q\\;t^{(A,I)}[\\beta].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 p.184 的解释序，统一改用下降方向。必须比较所有变量赋值，不能只检验变量全为某个常量的一次赋值。若 Q 是严格序，诱导关系也为严格序；A 非空保证存在赋值，避免空量词导致所有项都“大于自身”。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；6.2.1 following definition，印刷页 184。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-well-founded-monotone-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"54517e5af9b2ee4a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-well-founded-monotone-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"b729ff69dbfa830d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"b729ff69dbfa830d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$\\mathrm{Algebra}_\\Sigma(A,I)$，$Q\\subseteq A^2$，$s,t\\in T$；$u^{(A,I)}[\\beta]$ 为 [[56-df-satisfaction]] 的项解释，$\\beta\\in A^V$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Algebra}_\\Sigma(A,I)","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq A^2","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"u^{(A,I)}[\\beta]","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in A^V","display":false},{"tex":"s>_{(A,I,Q)}^{\\Sigma,V}t\\iff\n\\forall\\beta\\in A^V\\;\ns^{(A,I)}[\\beta]\\;Q\\;t^{(A,I)}[\\beta].","display":true}],"bytes":1376,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-224","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-interpretation-order.md]]"},{"id":"4193949606379958","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$\\mathrm{WFMonotoneAlg}_\\Sigma(A,I,Q)$；诱导关系 $>_{(A,I,Q)}^{\\Sigma,V}$ 见 [[56-df-interpretation-order]]。"},{"id":"a7b1b75a0e18bc22","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$、$\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$E\\subseteq T^2$；$\\to_{R/E}$ 为 [[56-df-rewrite-modulo-equations]] 的等价—一步—等价关系。$\\mathrm{EqModels}_\\Sigma(A,I,E)$ 采用 [[56-df-satisfaction]]，表示 I 解释下所有赋值满足 E。载体存在量词在集合论元语言中遍历非空集合 $A$；$I$ 遍历 $\\prod_{f\\in F}A^{A^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}}$，$Q\\subseteq A^2$。模型谓词和 [[56-df-interpretation-order]] 的诱导解释序都在合格代数上求值；基本解释终止接口见 [[56-thm-interpretation-termination]]。"},{"id":"1a2313edea993f6b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$、$\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$。载体存在量词在集合论元语言中遍历非空集合 $A$，运算族 $I$ 遍历 $\\prod_{f\\in F}A^{A^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}}$，关系 $Q$ 遍历 $\\mathcal P(A^2)$；[[56-df-interpretation-order]] 的诱导解释关系只在这些合格代数参数上求值。解释序与归约序、终止性的接口分别采用 [[56-thm-interpretation-order-reduction-order]] 与 [[56-thm-termination-by-reduction-order]]。"}],"outgoing":["54517e5af9b2ee4a","b729ff69dbfa830d","5e02461ce48023cc"]}